===Noun===
{{en-noun|flimsies}}

# Thin [[typing]] [[paper]] used to make multiple copies.
#* '''1977''', {{w|John Le Carré}}, ''The Honourable Schoolboy'', Folio Society 2010, p. 251:
#*: Smiley peered once more at the '''flimsy''' which he still clutched in his pudgy hand.
# {{label|en|informal|in the plural}} Skimpy [[underwear]].
#* {{quote-news|year=2007|date=October 25|author=Ruth La Ferla|title=Now It’s Nobody’s Secret|work=New York Times|url=http://www.nytimes.com/2007/10/25/fashion/shows/25LINGERIE.html
|passage=Choosing lingerie “is about what makes you look good, but also what looks good with or through your clothing,” said Monica Mitro, a spokeswoman for Victoria’s Secret, the brand that catapulted racy '''flimsies''' into the public eye.}}

